      "writtenOn": "2014-09-01T17:44:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "it looks like this function is actually trying to figure out if ID is used or id is used... why would ID ever be used? Why would id ever be used? Why is it correct to do this?",
      "revId": "2a199434463bd76720ab7b94e24abf5b6b474511",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
